3.2.5. Document Understanding
To tackle document understanding tasks, which require the model to comprehend and extract information from structured documents, we developed:
• Viet-Doc-VQA & Viet-Doc-VQA-II: These datasets were created from over 116,000 pages of Vietnamese textbooks, covering subjects from grades 1 to 12, including Mathematics, Literature, English, Physics, Chemistry, Biology, History, Geography, Civic Education, Computer Science, Technology, Music, Arts, and Physical Education. These datasets not only facilitate real-world document analysis but also help the model learn and understand educational content relevant to Vietnam.
• Viet-Geometry-VQA & Viet-ComputerScience-VQA: These datasets focus on scientific image understanding, particularly in math and logic problems, enabling the model to solve and interpret visual problems in these domains.
• Viet-Sketches-VQA: Designed to improve the model’s ability to understand symbolic representations and sketches, this dataset aids in tasks where visual abstraction and symbol interpretation are required.

